---
layout: layout.njk
title: "Contact Event'Light Amiens - sono, lumière, mapping"
description: "Event'Light, 53 rue du Général Friant, 80000 Amiens. Albéric Delabie 07 81 53 36 00, Antoine Capel 06 46 82 08 31, eventlight80@gmail.com."
permalink: "/contact/"
breadcrumbs:
  - name: Contact
---
<div class="wrap">
  <header class="page-head">
    {% include "breadcrumbs.njk" %}
    <p class="page-kicker mono">CONTACT</p>
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p class="lede">Une question, un calage, un devis : on est à Amiens et dans la Somme.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="contact-grid">
    {% for c in site.contacts %}
    <div class="contact-card">
      <h2>{{ c.nom }}</h2>
      <p><a href="{{ c.telHref }}">{{ c.tel }}</a></p>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
    <div class="contact-card">
      <h2>Écrire</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
      <p style="margin-top:12px">
        <a href="{{ site.facebook }}">Facebook</a> ·
        <a href="{{ site.instagram }}">Instagram</a> ·
        <a href="{{ site.youtube }}">YouTube</a>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:16px"><a class="btn solid" href="/devis/">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 3L20 12L4 21Z"/></svg>
        Composer un devis
      </a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-card">
      <h2>Zone</h2>
      <p>{{ site.address }}</p>
      <p>{{ site.livraison }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="map-embed">
    <iframe
      title="Carte - Event'Light, 53 rue du Général Friant, Amiens"
      loading="lazy"
      referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
      src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=53%20Rue%20du%20G%C3%A9n%C3%A9ral%20Friant%2080000%20Amiens&z=16&output=embed"></iframe>
  </div>
</div>
